<title>UK: TABLE-Treats reports profits decline.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Treats reports profits decline.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for year to December 25 1996 (million stg unless stated).</p>
<p>     Shr			   8.8   vs n/a</p>
<p>     Total dividend (pence)  3.0   vs n/a</p>
<p>     Pretax			1.42  vs 2.45</p>
<p>     Turnover		    22.29 vs 22.19</p>
<p>NOTE - comparative earnings per share and dividend figures were not given since the results were the first full-year figures since Treats Group joined the UK stock market in June 1996.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
